review/Architecture_Basic.*
review/Architecture_Basic_v2.*
review/LLD_Slide1_Preparation_Retrieval_v2.*
review/LLD_Slide2_Generation_Verification_v2.*
review/Architecture_Block_Diagram.*
review/Architecture_Flowchart_With_Data_Prep*
review/Architecture_LLD_Mermaid.md
review/Prep_LLD_*
# Version 1 export; RESEARCH_PAPER_DATA.md is the current one.
RESEARCH_PAPER_DATA.docx
